== B. Group velocity: simulated AM pulse through a plasma ==
PASS v_g = 1/(dbeta/dw) (finite difference) = c^2 beta/w
PASS v_p v_g = c^2
PASS v_g = c sqrt(1 - wp^2/w^2)
