PASS beta'' = -wp^2/(c (w^2-wp^2)^{3/2})
PASS envelope spreads only at 2nd order: width 25.426 vs Gaussian prediction 25.423
PASS dielectric: v_g = v_p = 1/sqrt(mu eps)
